# Generated by Cargo
debug
target

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. This crate is a library, and the
# conventional advice is to leave a library's lock file out — but that advice is
# about what downstream builds resolve, and it costs the thing worth more here:
# a reproducible CI run and a bisectable history. A consumer's own lock file
# still wins; this one only pins what this repository's own build and tests use.

# Local environment
.codex
.env

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate debugging information
*.pdb

# Generated by cargo mutants
**/mutants.out*/

# Coverage output files
*.info
lcov.info
